  74:   `.sidebar-btn[data-domain="engine"]` and waits for `#next-session-content` — but `initNextSession()`
  75:   (`public/js/admin.js:331`) is called under `domain === 'attendance'` today, not `'engine'`. The Next
  76:   Session panel is a real, live, still-used feature (`public/js/admin/next-session.js` still exists
  77:   and is still called) that was relocated to the Attendance domain at some point without its own test
